      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果向量$\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$, $\\vec{c}$共线(图78), 那么点$O$, $A$, $B$, $C$属于一",
        "条直线. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**2. 定义. 向量$\\vec{a}$乘以数$x$的积, 如果数$x$是正数, 那么所",
        "得的积与向量$\\vec{a}$同方向; 如果数$x$是负数, 那么积与向量$\\vec{a}$反",
        "方向. 积的长度等于向量$\\vec{a}$的长度与数$x$的绝对值的乘积.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "向量$\\vec{a}$乘以数$x$的积用$x\\vec{a}$表示. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在图79上画出的是向量$\\vec{a}$和$3\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$和$-\\frac{3}{2}\\vec{b}$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在上述定义中没有研究当$\\vec{a}=\\vec{0}$或者$x=0$的情况. 对于",
        "这些情况补充如下: "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x\\vec{0}=\\vec{0}$, 对于任何的$x$; "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$0\\vec{a}=\\vec{0}$, 对于任何的$\\vec{a}$. "
      ]
    },
